 ## Operating characteristics
-* **Time Complexity:** Insertion is $O(d)$ where $d$ is the depth of the octree, assuming constant-time child access [S1, G, unofficial].
-* **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to the number of active voxels and the depth of the tree [S1, G, unofficial].
